set -> store single variable
hset -> store multiple variables in a single key / Object
hgetall -> get all the variables stored in a key
hget -> get a specific variable stored in a key
hdel -> delete a specific variable stored in a key
del -> delete the entire key


Problems of using Redis Queuse witout any external package

- parallel workers can be assigned
- if item lost on pop, can;t be recovered
- etc

Externa Package used eg: BullMQ , to manage the queue operations on redis.

api are the producers.
workers are the consumers


Pub Sub -> inbuilt notification system in Redis (not limited to notification only).
Publisher , Subcriber
Pub - can be a worker, app, server etc, same are the Sub.

Publisher ------> Redis         -------> Subscribers(active/ passive)
                    Channels

Pubs send to the channel, subs keep listening the channel

Live Leader board :

4 functions:

incr 
zinerby 
zrevrange 
zrevrank

select, update, locking and transaction mechanism is req for live leaderboard -> all this can be done
using the incr itself.

end points:

POST-> /post/id/view increment the view count of the post

Post -> /leaderboard/score -> add points to a user score { req.body -> user and the score}

Get -> /leaderboard/ -> get top 10 leaders

Get -> /leaderboard/:userId/rank -> get rank of the user
